<title>The Philippines: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/philippines/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-philippines-2026-11-23T03:51:45.198Z</guid>
<pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 03:51:45 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;A driver was killed and a female passenger wounded in a gas-station shooting in BARMM’s SGA, while over 300 passengers were rescued after an engine fire on MV OceanJet 168 off Cebu. The Philippines announced plans to privatize nine airports by 2028 and tapped Dapitan fisherfolk for maritime monitoring, and 755 Filipinos returning from Sabah received assistance in Zamboanga City. Finland and the Philippines signed a maritime security pact that includes Australian assistance for drones and cybersecurity, complementing ongoing cooperation with France and Japan. The Philippine Coast Guard rescued 22 people from a distressed boat off Palawan. 176 battle-related deaths were reported in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dw.com/en/china-asean-countries-struggle-over-south-china-sea-code-of-conduct/a-80009799?maca=en-rss-en-world-4025-rdf&quot;&gt;Deutsche Welle&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqgFBVV95cUxNWEpZMG1ZRmthQWRxeVFlX2toMWxTVzFPYzlSNjAyUUh5WjlxM0tjd0N6cDhvcThkMVkyTVhuWGpUZGVlWnZXZkxzZGt1RUd0bEM5dXBEei1HV1BidHBfVkx1RElsMnpHOXhYcEJVVHlCcEZxZExoT3gta3R2QjNiT2QtcEtKMjFtaVVYanFvbkpQOWhhMFpISER4LV9sU2U3OGpFaEN2WFNlZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Modern Diplomacy&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxNMUNWc0x5UWNoQ0lnUWRwcEZ0T1JaVWdzWkt3TFE3OXlYQXhyYnJ2dTZUNmJjNXlSQVN6TXhfVktxU0pHQjE5b2p2TDV3dnRmUm1LY0hHcUNnUXNpXzdTLVZaU3JTNVdzVGVCWm5lQXI3LU02STFKU0JmS0gwcE1ZSDdOU0RyTDU4bld1QlJPVFF1V1Z0WUhFcE1xOW8xMGs3THNNVWJUdjQyWXZzUlV5cFVDdlVvU0Ny?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Mindanao Sentinel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivgFBVV95cUxQVy1OLUFfVy1mLUpxUEZMZ3ZQQUxKRkRNeTUyclJTcUtrUVVkWGJ4MldnQy1Mb1oyVmNtUnZuVjhucUdxS0ViVDh5T1RBUjN3UzA0ZUd0VXQ3R0VhcVJGNGIyTjktazVyRWlzMEpUelFsdTVkWXU5R3VQcjFsYlI2TUN5T0dwR2JnX3YybEtKdTMwS